{"uid":"85a5729f9e388120","name":"test_a_rewrite_outside_the_window_stays_refused_across_a_later_legitimate_append","fullName":"tests.test_hub_real_render_cap_whole_call#test_a_rewrite_outside_the_window_stays_refused_across_a_later_legitimate_append","historyId":"ce779562fd76c1df3faa53709626657e","time":{"start":1791968931087,"stop":1791968931206,"duration":119},"description":"Task cure-01-01-4 criterion (2): a same-size rewrite caught by\n    `LiveRenderIndex.flush`'s own bounded self-check, WHILE the tampered\n    line was still inside that self-check's own window, must stay refused\n    once a LATER legitimate append (fed and flushed by the exact same\n    writer object -- never a from-scratch rebuild) has since pushed the\n    tampered line outside the window relative to the NEW, larger covered\n    prefix. Never blessing a previously modified prefix just because\n    coverage grew: the persisted `poisoned` witness carries the\n    invalidation forward, at no extra read cost beyond the bounded\n    self-check `flush` already pays on every publish.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task cure-01-01-4 criterion (2): a same-size rewrite caught by<br />\n<code>LiveRenderIndex.flush</code>'s own bounded self-check, WHILE the tampered<br />\nline was still inside that self-check's own window, must stay refused<br />\nonce a LATER legitimate append (fed and flushed by the exact same<br />\nwriter object -- never a from-scratch rebuild) has since pushed the<br />\ntampered line outside the window relative to the NEW, larger covered<br />\nprefix. Never blessing a previously modified prefix just because<br />\ncoverage grew: the persisted <code>poisoned</code> witness carries the<br />\ninvalidation forward, at no extra read cost beyond the bounded<br />\nself-check <code>flush</code> already pays on every publish.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_